---
kind: scene
id: sefa.mapping
title: Mapping with Sefa
pov: ilo
# Once per dive, while the chart is open, sit with her over it.
on: talk
target: npc.sefa
priority: 20
once: run
when: "quest.sefaChart.state == 'active'"
---

## Chart table

@sefa{code="0010"}: Where did you get to this time?

<hub id="mapping" prompt="The chart is spread between you.">
  <choice id="depth" label="Tell her how deep you got" once>
    <match on="run.depth">
      <when is="..2">
        @ilo{code="0010"}: Not far. The antechamber, the flooded stair.
        @sefa{code="0020"}: Everyone has to start at the stair.
      </when>
      <otherwise>
        @ilo{code="0020"}: Chamber {{run.depth}}. Past the stair, past the hall.
        @sefa{code="0030" emotion="delighted"}: That's further than my grandmother's map goes.
        ::set{user.bond.sefa += 1}
      </otherwise>
    </match>
  </choice>
  <choice id="mother" label="Ask about her grandmother's map" once>
    @sefa{code="0040" emotion="shy"}: She drew the palace when it was still above water. Before the Regent pulled it down.
    ::set{user.bond.sefa += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="done" label="Leave her to it" exit>
    @sefa{code="0050"}: Go on. I've enough to ink for an hour.
  </choice>
</hub>
